# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PulseGuard AI — Git Ignore Rules
# Only exclude auto-downloadable large files & GPU models
# Small datasets ARE pushed so the repo is self-contained
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Very Large Files (auto-downloaded by script) ──────────
# Sentiment140 full (228 MB) — download from Kaggle
data/raw/training.1600000.processed.noemoticon.csv

# GPU merged training data (~9 GB) — auto-generated
data/processed/gpu_datasets/

# Trained GPU models (~3 GB) — generated during training
data/processed/gpu_models/

# Scikit-learn trained models — regenerated by train scripts
data/processed/models/*.joblib

# SQLite database — regenerated
data/processed/pulseguard.db

# ── Training Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────
training_log.txt
training_errors.txt

# ── Python Cache ──────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# ── Jupyter Notebook Checkpoints ──────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Virtual Environment ──────────────────────────────────
venv/
.venv/
env/
.env

# ── IDE Files ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.agents/

# ── OS Files ──────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
